============================================================
Splunk SSH Brute-Force Attack Detection
Dashboard Queries
============================================================


============================================================
1. FAILED SSH LOGIN EVENTS
Dashboard: Investigation / Failed Login Events
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| table _time _raw
| sort - _time
| head 20


============================================================
2. FAILED SSH LOGIN COUNT
Dashboard: Failed SSH Logins
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| stats count


============================================================
3. SUCCESSFUL SSH LOGIN COUNT
Dashboard: Successful SSH Logins
============================================================

index=linux "Accepted password"
| stats count


============================================================
4. TOP ATTACKING IPs
Dashboard: Top Attacking IPs
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| rex "from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| stats count by src_ip
| sort - count
| head 10


============================================================
5. BRUTE-FORCE ATTEMPTS OVER TIME
Dashboard: Brute-Force Attempts Over Time
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| timechart span=1h count as failed_logins


============================================================
6. TARGETED USERNAMES
Dashboard: Targeted Usernames
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| rex "Failed password for (?:invalid user )?(?<username>\S+)"
| stats count by username
| sort - count


============================================================
7. SUSPICIOUS IP DETECTION
Dashboard: Suspicious IPs
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| rex "from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| stats count as failed_attempts by src_ip
| where failed_attempts >= 20
| sort - failed_attempts


============================================================
8. CRITICAL SSH ALERTS
Dashboard: Critical SSH Alerts
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| rex "from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| stats count as failed_attempts by src_ip
| sort - failed_attempts
| head 10


============================================================
9. BRUTE-FORCE DETECTION
Detection / Threat Hunting Query
============================================================

index=linux "Failed password"
| rex "from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| stats count as failed_attempts by src_ip
| where failed_attempts >= 10
| sort - failed_attempts


============================================================
10. TOO MANY AUTHENTICATION FAILURES
Additional SSH Detection
============================================================

index=linux "Too many authentication failures"
| table _time _raw
| sort - _time
